            <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-5xl mx-auto mb-6 border border-indigo-100 shadow-inner">🎓</div>
            <h3 class="font-black text-gray-800 text-2xl mb-2">Pengumuman!</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                Selamat! Kamu sudah menyelesaikan 5 pertemuan berturut-turut. <br><br>
                Jangan lupa minggu depan <b>Ujian <span id="examReminderSubject" class="uppercase text-indigo-600 font-black">Mapel</span></b>. <br>
                Pelajari lagi materi yang telah diajarkan ya!
            </p>
            <button onclick="closeExamReminder()" class="w-full py-4 bg-indigo-600 text-white font-black rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 active:scale-95 transition-all text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">
                Siap, Laksanakan!
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- [BARU] MODAL MINTA PERPANJANGAN WAKTU (DISPENSASI) -->
    <div id="modalExtReq" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 z-[300] hidden items-center justify-center p-4 backdrop-blur-md transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-0">
        <div id="modalExtReqBox" class="bg-white w-full max-w-sm rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl p-6 transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300 border-4 border-amber-400 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-4xl mx-auto mb-4 border-4 border-white shadow-lg">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-800 text-center mb-1">Yahh, Kamu Telat!</h2>
            <p id="extReqMsg" class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-bold text-center mb-5">Batas waktu PR ini sudah lewat. Minta perpanjangan ke Kak Aziz ya.</p>

            <label class="block text-[11px] font-black text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Kenapa telat ngerjain?</label>
            <textarea id="extReqReason" rows="3" maxlength="300"
                class="w-full p-3 text-sm bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-400 focus:border-amber-400 outline-none resize-none"
                placeholder="Tulis alasanmu di sini, mis. ketiduran, ada acara keluarga, sinyal jelek..."></textarea>

            <div class="space-y-2.5 mt-5">
                <button id="btnSendExtReq" onclick="submitExtensionRequest()" class="w-full py-4 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white font-black rounded-2xl shadow-lg active:scale-95 transition-all text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane mr-1"></i> Kirim Permintaan
                </button>
                <button onclick="closeExtReq()" class="w-full py-3 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-500 font-bold rounded-2xl active:scale-95 transition-all text-xs">
                    Nanti Saja
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- [2.3] Modal Konfirmasi Waktu Habis: beli waktu (koin) atau minta gratis ke guru -->
    <div id="modalTimeUp" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 z-[320] hidden items-center justify-center p-4 backdrop-blur-md transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-0">
        <div id="modalTimeUpBox" class="bg-white w-full max-w-sm rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl p-6 transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300 border-4 border-rose-400 text-center overflow-hidden">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-4xl mx-auto mb-4 border-4 border-white shadow-lg">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-end"></i>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-800 mb-1">Waktu Kamu Sudah Habis!</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-bold leading-relaxed mb-2">
                Tenang, kamu masih punya kesempatan untuk <b>menambah waktu</b> dan melanjutkan dari soal terakhir.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 mb-5">
                <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-700">💰 Koinmu: <span id="timeUpWallet">0</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2.5">
                <button onclick="timeUpBuy()" class="w-full py-4 bg-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-600 text-white font-black rounded-2xl shadow-lg active:scale-95 transition-all text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> Beli Waktu (Instan, pakai Koin)
                </button>
                <button id="btnTimeUpAsk" onclick="timeUpAskTeacher()" class="w-full py-4 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white font-black rounded-2xl shadow-lg active:scale-95 transition-all text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-heart"></i> Minta Gratis ke Guru
                </button>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold leading-snug px-2">Catatan: permohonan gratis ke guru hanya bisa dilakukan <b>satu kali</b>. Pilih dengan bijak ya.</p>
                <button onclick="timeUpSkip()" class="w-full py-3 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-500 font-bold rounded-2xl active:scale-95 transition-all text-xs">
                    Tidak, Kumpulkan Apa Adanya
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- [2.7] Modal Info Terkunci: kesempatan sudah dipakai / sedang menunggu guru -->
    <div id="modalInfoLocked" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/85 z-[330] hidden items-center justify-center p-4 backdrop-blur-md transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-0">
        <div id="modalInfoLockedBox" class="bg-white w-full max-w-sm rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl p-7 transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300 text-center border-4 border-gray-300 overflow-hidden">
            <div id="infoLockedIcon" class="w-20 h-20 bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-4xl mx-auto mb-4 border-4 border-white shadow-lg">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>
            </div>
            <h2 id="infoLockedTitle" class="text-xl font-black text-gray-800 mb-2">Kesempatan Sudah Habis</h2>
            <p id="infoLockedMsg" class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-bold leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Kamu sudah pernah diberi perpanjangan waktu tapi belum sempat mengerjakannya. Maaf, kesempatan tidak bisa dipakai lagi. Hubungi Kak Aziz langsung ya.
            </p>
            <button onclick="closeInfoLocked()" class="w-full py-4 bg-gray-800 text-white font-black rounded-2xl shadow-lg active:scale-95 transition-all text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Oke, Mengerti</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <Mascot />
    <PhotoBooth />
    <div class="relative z-[99999]">
        <Toast />
    </div>
</Layout>

